[{"_1":2,"_3":4},"root",{"_5":38},"en/routes/conteudo-do-cubo.tsx",{"_5":6},"data",{"_7":8,"_9":10,"_11":12,"_13":14,"_15":16,"_17":18,"_19":-7,"_20":21,"_22":-7,"_23":24,"_25":26},"tipo","etapa","cubo",{"_11":35,"_13":36,"_28":37},"id","estrela","nome","Star and 1st face","rascunho",false,"html","<p>The Megaminx has 12 faces, but it is solved like the 3x3: one face first, then the layers around it, and the top one at the end. Here white goes on the bottom and yellow on top, as on the 3x3. The faces have their own names: around the top one, <code>F</code> (the front one), <code>R</code>, <code>L</code> and the back ones; below, between two top faces, <code>DR</code> (the front right one) and <code>DL</code> (the front left one).</p>\n<div class=\"diagramas\"><figure class=\"diagrama\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/be993ea4655cad21.svg\" alt=\"The goal, seen from below: the white face done, with the side colors matching.\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>The goal, seen from below: the white face done, with the side colors matching.</figcaption></figure></div>\n<h2>The star</h2>\n<p>First, the 5 white edges around the white center: the &quot;star&quot;, like the 3x3 <a href=\"/en/glossary#cruz\" class=\"termo-do-glossario\" title=\"The 4 edges of one face (usually white) in place, lined up with the centers. The first step of the beginner method and of CFOP.\">cross</a>. Each edge has another color, which has to match the center of the neighboring face.</p>\n<div class=\"diagramas\"><figure class=\"diagrama\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/42cf3fdeaede3210.svg\" alt=\"The finished star.\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>The finished star.</figcaption></figure></div>\n<p>It comes without an algorithm. Look for a white edge, turn the top faces until it is above its place and bring it down by turning the bottom face on that side (<code>DR</code>, <code>DL</code>…). The ones already in stay on the bottom and don&#39;t move.</p>\n<div class=\"diagramas\"><figure class=\"diagrama tira\"><ol aria-label=\"DR2'\"><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/89611563a27831a5-0.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>DR2'</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/89611563a27831a5-1.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"></li></ol><figcaption>The white edge on the DR face: turn DR until it goes down into place.</figcaption></figure></div>\n<h2>The corners: the sexy move</h2>\n<p>Now come the 5 white corners, with the Megaminx <a href=\"/en/glossary#sexy-move\" class=\"termo-do-glossario\" title=\"The trigger R U R' U', the most common of all.\">sexy move</a>: <code>DR F DR&#39; F&#39;</code>. It&#39;s the same idea as the 3x3&#39;s <code>R U R&#39; U&#39;</code>.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Hold it with white on the bottom and the empty spot in front, on the bottom: between <code>DR</code> and <code>DL</code>.</li>\n<li>Turn the top faces until the corner is at the bottom tip of the front face, right above the spot.</li>\n<li>Repeat the sexy move until the corner goes down with white facing down.</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"diagramas\"><figure class=\"diagrama\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/539ddb64c8cc98a0.svg\" alt=\"White facing right (DR): 1 sexy move.\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>White facing right (DR): 1 sexy move.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"diagrama\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/56833db38f0f8670.svg\" alt=\"White facing front (F): 3 sexy moves.\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>White facing front (F): 3 sexy moves.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"diagrama\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/4cee139d436e31c2.svg\" alt=\"White facing left (DL): 5 sexy moves.\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>White facing left (DL): 5 sexy moves.</figcaption></figure></div>\n<div class=\"diagramas\"><figure class=\"diagrama tira\"><ol aria-label=\"DR F DR' F'\"><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/1edb70893a66c07f-0.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>DR</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/1edb70893a66c07f-1.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>F</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/1edb70893a66c07f-2.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>DR'</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/1edb70893a66c07f-3.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>F'</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/1edb70893a66c07f-4.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"></li></ol><figcaption>White facing right, one sexy move and done.</figcaption></figure></div>\n<p>You don&#39;t need to count: do the sexy move and look. The star and the other corners stay in place, because the sexy move only moves the front bottom corner. If a corner is already on the bottom, but wrong, hold it in that spot and do one sexy move to bring it up.</p>\n","treino","metodos",[30],"anterior","proximo",{"_13":27,"_28":29},"grupos",[],"Middle layers","endereco","/megaminx/f2l",{"_13":31,"_32":33,"_28":34},"Layers","numero",1,"/megaminx/camadas#estrela","megaminx","Megaminx","/megaminx/",{"_39":40,"_41":42},"cubos",[45,46,47,48,49,50],"idiomas",[43,44],"pt","en",{"_11":56,"_13":56},{"_11":55,"_13":55},{"_11":54,"_13":54},{"_11":53,"_13":53},{"_11":35,"_13":36},{"_11":51,"_13":52},"pyraminx","Pyraminx","5x5","4x4","2x2","3x3"]
